.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Builds a vibronic progression from the Huang-Rhys displacement parameter, verifies the Franck-Condon factors&#x27; normalization (they must sum to 1 -- the required correctness check for any Franck-Condon calculation), and shows how a larger excited-state displacement shifts the most-intense vibronic peak to higher v&#x27;.">

.. only:: html

  .. image:: /api/gallery/spectro/electronic/images/thumb/sphx_glr_plot_01_franck_condon_thumb.png
